	(text "MOTOR DRIVERS: 6x DRV8251A (one H-bridge per motor)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 43.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0c079ce5-a0a2-480b-9af7-ef3c114eb339")
	)
	(text "VM = VSYS: the pack after the power switch (5.6-8.4 V on a 2S pack, 8.4-12.6 V on 3S; DRV8251A 4.5-48 V, 50 V abs max; D4 on the power sheet clamps VSYS).\nEach driver: 10 uF + 100 nF on VM (C3/C4 U1, C6/C7 U2, C10/C11 U3, C75/C76 U15, C77/C78 U16, C79/C80 U17); GND pin and pad to GND.\nCurrent limit: I_TRIP x 1575 uA/A = V_VREF / R_IPROPI (DRV8251A SLVSFU6). VREF 2.53 V from R107 10k / R108 33k (C81) feeds all six;\nR101-R106 1.2k -> 1.34 A (+-5 %). The 25GA-370 motors stall at ~1.5-1.6 A at 12.6 V, ~1 A at 8.4 V.\nAt the limit the driver brakes on both low-side FETs for 25 us. Six stalled motors draw ~8 A.\nInputs: IN1 = GPIOn_MxA, IN2 = GPIOn_MxB; both low for ~1 ms = sleep (no nSLEEP/nFAULT pins).\nM2, M4, M6 are wired reversed (OUT1 to pin 2) as before, so the firmware's direction handling is unchanged."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a29ae1a8-90c8-46ce-ace2-3cdede86743f")
	)
